put(6, '<section class="recreated-page bubblegum-docs" aria-label="Malcolm and Charlie WhatsApp"><h2>WhatsApp chat between Malcolm Parker and Charlie Chiba</h2><div class="bubblegum-chat"><div class="chat-time">12:06</div>' + ''.join(bubble(w,e,z,w=="Charlie") for w,e,z in chat6) + '</div></section>')

angelina = [("Hi Malcolm","Malcolm 你好："),("Good to hear from you again. Hope the weather is better in London.","很高興再收到你的消息，希望倫敦天氣好一些。"),("Anyway, I’ve managed to find you a room for holding the interview (room 829). It’s excellent for conducting interviews and it will be available on 19th May (Tuesday) from 2:00pm to 5:00pm. I will personally make sure that no more than 4 people are allowed in to do the interview as you requested.","我找到適合訪問的 829 號房，5 月 19 日星期二下午 2 至 5 時可使用。我會按你的要求確保訪問者不超過四人。"),("Just to warn you that the hotel has some really tough rules about dress. Basically, the hotel will tell anyone who isn’t wearing smart clothes to leave. And sandals? Absolutely not!","酒店有嚴格衣着規定：衣着不整者會被請離，亦絕不能穿涼鞋。"),("Also, our helicopter will be ready at 5.30pm at Atlantic Plaza on 18th May (Monday). I am sure Bubblegum will enjoy the flight back to the hotel.","直升機將於 5 月 18 日星期一下午 5:30 在 Atlantic Plaza 準備好，接樂隊返回酒店。"),("Looking forward to another drink (or three!) with you soon.","期待很快再跟你喝幾杯。")]
bonnie = [("Dear Mr. Parker,","Parker 先生："),("We are students at St. Godfrey’s Catholic School and we are really BIG fans of Bubblegum. We think their music is really great to listen to and their image is really cool and trendy.","我們是 St. Godfrey’s Catholic School 的學生，也是 Bubblegum 的忠實歌迷，很喜歡他們的音樂和形象。"),("We would be so honoured if they could do an interview with some of our senior students from our Media Club. What we would like to know is:","如果他們能接受媒體學會高年級學生的訪問，我們會非常榮幸。我們想知道："),("The time, place and length of time for the interview. (Please note that due to school activities during the week Bubblegum are in Hong Kong, we will only be free after 4pm)","訪問的時間、地點和長度。由於校內活動，我們只在下午 4 時後有空。"),("I know this is short notice and the band will be really busy in Hong Kong, but if you could find any time in their schedule to have an interview with us then that would be amazing.","我知道提出得很倉促，樂隊訪港也很忙，但若能安排任何訪問時間就太好了。"),("Please tell Bubblegum how much we love them!","請向 Bubblegum 轉達我們的喜愛！")]
put(7, '<section class="recreated-page bubblegum-docs" aria-label="Angelina email and St. Godfrey’s letter"><h2>Email from Angelina Dai to Malcolm Parker</h2><div class="email-document"><div class="email-window"><div class="email-headers"><div><strong>To:</strong> Malcolm Parker</div><div><strong>From:</strong> Angelina Dai</div><div><strong>Date:</strong> April 1 2015</div><div><strong>Subject:</strong> Update</div></div><div class="email-content">' + ''.join(b(*p) for p in angelina) + '<p>Angelina<br>General Manager<br>Paradise Gardens Hotel</p></div></div></div><h2>Letter from pupils at St. Godfrey’s Catholic School to Malcolm Parker</h2><div class="bubblegum-letter"><h3>ST. GODFREY’S CATHOLIC SCHOOL</h3><p class="letter-date">March 20, 2015</p>' + ''.join(b(*p) for p in bonnie[:3]) + '<ul><li>' + b(*bonnie[3]) + '</li></ul>' + ''.join(b(*p) for p in bonnie[4:]) + '<p>Yours sincerely,<br>Bonnie Ng<br>Chairperson of the Media Club<br>St. Godfrey’s Catholic School</p></div></section>')

podcast = [
    ("Sarah Wilde","Woo! Charlie Chiba from Bubblegum. So how’s it going?","哇！Bubblegum 的 Charlie Chiba，最近怎樣？"),("Charlie Chiba","Great to be here.","很高興來到這裏。"),("Sara Wilde","So tell us about yourself Charlie.","Charlie，介紹一下自己吧。"),("Charlie Chiba","Well, I’m actually not from London like everyone thinks. I was born way up North.","其實我不像大家以為的那樣來自倫敦，我出生在很北的地方。"),("Sara Wilde","In Scotland, you mean?","你指蘇格蘭？"),("Charlie Chiba","Yeah, in a tiny village. In 1996.","對，一條小村莊，1996 年出生。"),("Sara Wilde","Wow! And your dad was Japanese right?","你爸爸是日本人，對嗎？"),("Charlie Chiba","Yes, but my mum is English. We moved down to London when I was 6 years old.","對，媽媽是英國人。我六歲時搬到倫敦。"),("Sara Wilde","Do you ever get scared by your fans, Charlie? You must have heard about that all-girl Japanese band who were attacked by a crazy man with a knife.","你會害怕歌迷嗎？你應該聽過那支日本女子樂隊被持刀男子襲擊的事。"),("Charlie Chiba","Oh, sometimes. But we have rules to protect us. If anyone wants to interview us then they need to…","有時會，但我們有保護自己的規則。想訪問我們的人需要……"),("Sara Wilde","…let me guess. Show our ID card, right? Ha ha. Actually listeners, we had to do this… and they searched our bags and equipment! Crazy!","讓我猜猜，要出示身分證？對，我們還要讓他們檢查袋子和器材！"),("Charlie Chiba","Those are the rules for interviewing us for every interview I’m afraid! Ha ha!","恐怕每次訪問都要遵守這些規則！"),("Sara Wilde","You joined Bubblegum in 2013, but what was your career like before you joined?","你 2013 年加入 Bubblegum，之前的事業如何？"),("Charlie Chiba","Oh dear. Ha, ha. What can I say? I did win best singer in the London Youth Music Awards, so I guess it wasn’t all bad news, I suppose.","這該怎說？我曾獲倫敦青年音樂獎最佳歌手，所以也不全是壞事。"),("Sara Wilde","Were you still at school then?","那時你還在上學嗎？"),("Charlie Chiba","Yeah, it was 2010. So yeah.","是，那是 2010 年。"),("Sara Wilde","Actually, I think I remember your solo album, “Oh So Pretty” in 2012. Oh dear! But let’s move on eh? Now, our listeners might be interested to know that you went to the same school as me.","我記得你 2012 年的個人專輯《Oh So Pretty》。我們換個話題吧；聽眾或許有興趣知道我們讀同一所學校。"),("Charlie Chiba","That’s right. Gray’s School of Music and Drama. Ha ha. But you were a few years above me.","對，Gray’s School of Music and Drama，不過你比我高幾級。"),("Sara Wilde","But we’re both still young. Ha ha. I suppose we had the same teachers though. Did you have Mr. Wildgoose?","但我們都還年輕。可能有同樣的老師。Wildgoose 先生教過你嗎？"),("Charlie Chiba","No, but I remember the stories!","沒有，但我記得他的故事！")]
